        "title": "The diagram shows the layout of part of a building, indicating the position of the fire exits. Summarize the information by selecting and reporting the main features and make comparisons where relevant.",
        "status": "published",
        "content_writing": "<div data-page-id=\"WC9GdWptxodM3rxqUu4lYwk6gDd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><em><strong>The diagram shows the layout of part of a building, indicating the position of the fire exits. </strong></em></span><em style=\"font-size: 12pt; text-align: justify;\"><strong>Summarize the information by selecting and reporting the main features and make comparisons where relevant.</strong></em></div>",
        "order": 1,
        "instruction": "<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">HƯỚNG DẪN VIẾT B&Agrave;I</h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><em>IELTS Writing Task 1 - Building Layout with Fire Exits</em></p>\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UQlGdpAaUoJFOsxWOYzlDAiUgDe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>1.</strong><strong> </strong><strong>Giải th&iacute;ch đề</strong></span></h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N0nNdqrxtoU9EGxkGvml6QHzgzd\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GWPNd7ft0oPRpuxfDGnl1aKWgoe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QxWPdDnfdod2NixZJAjlLYzqgGb\">Đề b&agrave;i Building Layout with Fire Exits y&ecirc;u cầu m&ocirc; tả bố cục một phần của một t&ograve;a nh&agrave;,&nbsp;<span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">chỉ ra vị tr&iacute; của <strong>c&aacute;c lối tho&aacute;t hiểm</strong><em> (</em></span><em><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">fire exits</span></em><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><em>)</em> v&agrave; c&aacute;c đường di tản li&ecirc;n quan. Đ&acirc;y l&agrave; dạng so s&aacute;nh tĩnh,</span><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">&nbsp;kh&ocirc;ng c&oacute; sự thay đổi theo thời gian.</span></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QxWPdDnfdod2NixZJAjlLYzqgGb\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TTLqda2f9ooxOTxsgKLlEoHXgHc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>2.</strong><strong> Định hướng viết Introduction</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J4uYdJ7WaomtjrxzeNDl41h0g1n\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DQntd3hjzoNCjwxOfz4lvHOcgbb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N9LhdhEVXoJnGNxJPvyl0YZPg9e\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CRT6dLvfRoVbHtxCnc9l7AdygTl\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-KGfkdvXnMo9tBVxWubvlf0gagVh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TOoQd6oJTo25Hhxi84tlE4FPgnb\"><strong>Nội dung:</strong> Paraphrase đề Building Layout with Fire Exits với c&aacute;c dữ kiện ch&iacute;nh l&agrave;: <span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">bố cục của một khu vực trong t&ograve;a nh&agrave;</span><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">&nbsp;v&agrave; <strong>c&aacute;c đường tho&aacute;t hiểm</strong><em> (</em></span><em><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">evacuation routes</span></em><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><em>)</em> từ 7 ph&ograve;ng ngủ đến 2 lối ra.</span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J4uYdJ7WaomtjrxzeNDl41h0g1n\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>3.</strong><strong> Định hướng viết Overview</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WTQ0dwsgtot3Mux4ZXOl05hSgTH\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AmqcddMWAotWQFxJT6xl8CElghf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RKcrd7u17ogCsex6cUPlJ2cCgkh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JLrudDKQVoB78vxXmgzldmNBgLh\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-U7iadbsa0o9CMOxYDBClUkAhgse\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, với dạng đề map, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ tập trung n&oacute;i về 2 th&ocirc;ng tin ch&iacute;nh:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ng-star-inserted\">\n<p class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">Bố cục tổng thể của t&ograve;a nh&agrave; <strong>được tổ chức xoay quanh một</strong> <strong>h&agrave;nh lang trung t&acirc;m</strong> <em>(organized around a central corridor)</em>, v&agrave; thiết kế n&agrave;y chia 7 ph&ograve;ng ngủ th&agrave;nh 2 nh&oacute;m ch&iacute;nh một c&aacute;ch r&otilde; rệt.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ng-star-inserted\">\n<p class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">Mỗi nh&oacute;m ph&ograve;ng được phục vụ bởi một lối tho&aacute;t hiểm ri&ecirc;ng <em><strong>nằm ở </strong></em><strong>hai đầu đối diện</strong><em><strong> </strong>(positioned at opposite ends)</em> của h&agrave;nh lang. Cả hai lối ra n&agrave;y đều c&oacute; cầu thang v&agrave; dẫn đến<em> một </em><strong>điểm tập kết</strong><em> (</em></span><em><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">meeting point</span></span></em><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><em>) </em>cụ thể ở b&ecirc;n ngo&agrave;i.</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JLrudDKQVoB78vxXmgzldmNBgLh\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JLrudDKQVoB78vxXmgzldmNBgLh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>4.</strong><strong> Ph&acirc;n chia BODY r&otilde; r&agrave;ng</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RIbUdfSlNoloclxlVrOltQUhg8e\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-P98ZdcS4KoF2cIxRdnYl02e4gre\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FVyzdmf9noY8HEx1DxAl475ZgPh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZRV0dgAnjoXiRVxRxmol5UwwgBb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PlnOdHjiuoEse4xeDDrlsghVgug\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ chia đoạn th&acirc;n b&agrave;i một c&aacute;ch r&otilde; r&agrave;ng, bằng c&aacute;ch gom c&aacute;c chi tiết dựa tr&ecirc;n ti&ecirc;u ch&iacute; về mặt <strong>địa l&yacute;</strong>:</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PlnOdHjiuoEse4xeDDrlsghVgug\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PlnOdHjiuoEse4xeDDrlsghVgug\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CpWhdSGJFoye2PxbbFelCRADg5e\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<h4 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FKLxd8T0jomlW3xlEQ5lfJGxgwb\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>BODY 1:</strong><strong> <strong class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">Khu vực lối tho&aacute;t hiểm A (ph&iacute;a b&ecirc;n tr&aacute;i)</span></strong></strong></span></h4>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Xz8Sd3833oJVsmxgnsUlprJUgUb\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ định hướng c&aacute;c bạn viết từng bước ở BODY 1 như sau:</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Vw50dZaq3oF2ZIxm3TBlq500gRe\">\n<ul>\n<li class=\"ng-star-inserted\">\n<p class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">X&aacute;c định c&aacute;c ph&ograve;ng được phục vụ bởi lối ra n&agrave;y l&agrave; Ph&ograve;ng 1, 2 v&agrave; 3, với đường tho&aacute;t hiểm l&agrave; <strong>đi về ph&iacute;a b&ecirc;n tr&aacute;i của h&agrave;nh lang</strong> <em>(</em></span><em><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">proceed into the main corridor and turn left</span></span></em><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><em>)</em>.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ng-star-inserted\">\n<p class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">M&ocirc; tả vị tr&iacute; của lối ra n&agrave;y l&agrave; <strong>nằm cạnh một cầu thang</strong> <em>(</em></span><em><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">located next to a staircase</span></span></em><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><em>)</em> dẫn xuống Điểm tập kết 1.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ng-star-inserted\">\n<p class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">So s&aacute;nh sự thuận tiện của c&aacute;c ph&ograve;ng, trong đ&oacute; Ph&ograve;ng 1 <strong>nằm đối diện cầu thang</strong> <em>(</em></span><em><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">situated directly opposite the stairs</span></span></em><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><em>)</em> v&agrave; Ph&ograve;ng 3 cũng<strong> ở rất gần</strong> <em>(</em></span><em><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">in very close proximity</span></span><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">).</span></em></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n<br>\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<h4 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-P28wdkqCxoxJzCxhGfIlLa1cgwd\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\">&nbsp;BODY</span><strong>&nbsp;2:</strong><strong> <strong class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">Khu vực lối tho&aacute;t hiểm B (ph&iacute;a b&ecirc;n phải)</span></strong></strong></span></h4>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PlnOdHjiuoEse4xeDDrlsghVgug\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-EwzTddSWRoqDSGxM4hFlvPg1grc\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OrA9dgGjNoRCVUxfgJ1lOWFlglh\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ định hướng c&aacute;c bạn viết từng bước ở BODY 2 như sau:</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OrA9dgGjNoRCVUxfgJ1lOWFlglh\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<ul class=\"ng-star-inserted\">\n<li class=\"ng-star-inserted\">\n<p class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">X&aacute;c định đ&acirc;y l&agrave; lối ra <strong>phục vụ cho số lượng ph&ograve;ng lớn hơn</strong> <em>(</em></span><em><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">serves a larger group</span></em><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><em>)</em>, bao gồm c&aacute;c ph&ograve;ng 4, 5, 6, v&agrave; 7.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ng-star-inserted\">\n<p class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">Chỉ ra c&aacute;c đặc điểm kh&aacute;c biệt của khu vực n&agrave;y, bao gồm vị tr&iacute; của Ph&ograve;ng 5 v&agrave; 6 <strong>nằm l&ugrave;i v&agrave;o trong một hốc tường nhỏ</strong> <em>(</em></span><em><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">set back from the main corridor in a small recess</span><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">).</span></em></p>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ng-star-inserted\">\n<p class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">Chỉ ra thang m&aacute;y</span><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">&nbsp;nằm gần lối ra n&agrave;y hơn v&agrave; lối ra n&agrave;y cũng c&oacute; cầu thang dẫn đến Điểm tập kết 2.</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
