            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"WC9GdWptxodM3rxqUu4lYwk6gDd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AAoAdNfhdovb2yx09pWlFU2LgSf\">Overall, the floor plan is clearly organized around a long central corridor, with two emergency exits positioned at opposite ends. Consequently, the seven bedrooms are divided into two main groups, each served by the nearest fire exit. Each of these exits is equipped with a staircase and leads to a specific external meeting point.</div>\n</div>",
