            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"WC9GdWptxodM3rxqUu4lYwk6gDd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Icm3d76HuouJFcxj2HzlLwEMgag\">Looking at the left-hand side of the diagram, Fire Exit A is the designated escape route for occupants in Bedrooms 1, 2, and 3. To evacuate, residents from these rooms must proceed into the main corridor and turn left. This exit is located next to a staircase which leads down to Meeting Point 1. Among these three rooms, Bedroom 1 is situated directly opposite the stairs, while Bedroom 3 is also in very close proximity to the exit.</div>\n</div>",
